BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:WTF is “the Intersection of Art and Technology”
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261123
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261129
DTSTAMP:20261123T172511Z
UID:3f8d0fff-4163-8001-834f-c1ed9ee9d16e@notion2cal
DESCRIPTION:In this video\, I talk about what the "intersection of art and
  technology" actually means and why this label has suddenly become so pres
 ent in museums\, arts grants\, and cultural discourse right now.\nThrough 
 Heidegger\, Groys\, Yuk Hai\, Steyerl\, Malevich\, and Bataille\, I examin
 e how the museum lost its original archival function to the internet and i
 s being repurposed by tech wealth as a tool for historicizing its own stor
 y of progress. 
URL:https://app.notion.com/p/WTF-is-the-Intersection-of-Art-and-Technology
 -3f8d0fff41638001834fc1ed9ee9d16e
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
